      <xs:include schemaLocation="../../Model/BODs/GetRFI.xsd">
        <xs:annotation>
          <xs:documentation>The purpose of the GetRFI BOD is to query another business application or module for information about one or more RFI instances. The response is a ShowRFI BOD.  The Get verb takes several parameters to constrain the data of interest including RFI identity and subset.</xs:documentation>
          <xs:documentation>Generally speaking, the Get verb plays the "Read" role in a CRUD data access layer.  Like SQL for a database, the Get verb allows for "selection" and "projection".  That is, data to return can be selected based on identity and values for other fields (the WHERE clause in SQL).  Matching data can be projected onto a specific set of fields of interest (the SELECT clause in SQL) to return.  However, the full expressiveness of SQL is not used.</xs:documentation>
        </xs:annotation>
      </xs:include>
